<v Mom>Yeah, and separate realities. I didn't say that. He said that he's not going to change his religious viewpoints. He's not going to change. And then I just said it. And I just don't see a path where this marriage can continue. I don't see a path for me.
<v Mom>是啊，独立的现实。我没说那句话。他说他不会改变他的宗教观点。他不会改变。然后我脱口而出了。我实在看不出这段婚姻还能维持下去的路径。我看不到属于我的路径。

